<title>POLAND: Krosno Q1 net falls to PLN 1.8 mln.</title>
<headline>Krosno Q1 net falls to PLN 1.8 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Krosno preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 2.64 vs	4.98</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   3.01 vs	4.44</p>
<p>    net profit				 1.76 vs	2.87</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Krosnienskie Huty Szkla Krosno SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				 45.47 vs     44.80</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  32.58 vs     30.21</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   1.01 vs     0.00</p>
<p>    income tax				 1.15 vs     2.87</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.11 vs     0.05</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     0.33 vs     1.52</p>
<p>    financial costs			  0.96 vs     2.05</p>
<p>    investment				 0.70 vs     0.58</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
